<section class="install">
  <h2>Quick Start</h2>
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step">
      <span class="num">1</span>
      <div>
        <strong>Install the extension</strong>
        <p>Search "Cortex" in VS Code Extensions, or install from the <a href="https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=daniquir.cortex" target="_blank">Marketplace</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <span class="num">2</span>
      <div>
        <strong>Connect a provider</strong>
        <p>Open Cortex sidebar → "Abrir OpenCode" → connect your AI provider (OpenAI, Anthropic, etc.).</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <span class="num">3</span>
      <div>
        <strong>Start coding</strong>
        <p>Ask questions, generate code, refactor — Cortex handles the rest.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .install { padding: 4rem 0; }
  .install h2 {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .steps { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .num {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .step strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
  .step p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0; }
</style>
